      "excerpts": [
        {
          "section": "You should know suggestions",
          "text": "When it finds one, it shows a short note above the prompt input:"
        },
        {
          "section": "You should know suggestions",
          "text": "While it's on, a side agent rereads the conversation from time to time as Claude works through a longer task."
        },
        {
          "section": "You should know suggestions",
          "text": "The side agent is a separate request to the same model and has no tools, so it can't read files, run commands, or change what Claude does."
        },
        {
          "section": "Cost of checks",
          "text": "Each check sends what's already in Claude's context, meaning the conversation so far with its tool results, followed by the mod's own instructions and the text of your recent notes."
        },
        {
          "section": "Cost of checks",
          "text": "The conversation part is read from the session's prompt cache on the same terms as Claude's own next request."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Learn more: opens a short explanation under the note, with its own choices:"
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Knew this already: closes the note and marks the topic as known."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Dismiss: closes the note."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Type the choice's digit on its own into an empty prompt input."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Chat in main session: quotes the note into your prompt input so you can add a question and send it to Claude"
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "The main agent doesn't see a note unless you send it with Chat in main session."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Claude Code keeps your recent notes and the topics you marked as known in a file whose name starts with cc-plugin-you-should-know under ~/.claude/plugins/store/."
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Each check, in this session and later ones, lists them to the side agent as ones not to repeat."
        },
        {
          "section": "Cost of checks",
          "text": "To watch the checks happen, set CLAUDE_CODE_YOU_SHOULD_KNOW_DEBUG=1 in your shell before you start Claude Code."
        },
        {
          "section": "Turn off You should know",
          "text": "After you choose Dismiss on a note without opening Learn more first, choose Turn off suggestions on the Dismissed. line, which clears after 20 seconds"
        },
        {
          "section": "Answer a note",
          "text": "Understood: closes it and marks the topic as known"
        }
      ]
    },
